        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f11be1ec4fab8e794e43b898",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在盛况空前的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 中，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>如愿摘下了首次胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1106362d700d19dd155c33465224284f0e44e0833cc10645da368ddc340568b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7f276184516c783a48c369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽是首次参加大赛的王牌，但面对突如其来的盛大舞台也完美地克服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a79ccd344b0de66209da2dad3a69fb386b271f2dbb8846c928227c9b7baa93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89495569545eee195ab7bfde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次首度参加大赛就展现出了精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "320a4660b5b5fe788576389cc899eda69c68e0ed6155a4a86502d431a0032966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:972031a52e1f41c4c90eee54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以首次参赛的赛马娘之姿登场，并且赢得比赛简直是戏剧性的发展。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f395b0e88959810bdee340091b2d9d523638b4cba66f628e09a73aafecf5aa9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b1b91b2992f5ecf28db844",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮。<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>以<bashin>成功获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "672b1c21a7cbbaa8a5290c91e6d9f4e80c70efe2a01a13eb70d90ad7dc4c02da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd8d8661f5b49a5ae8cbf30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "漂亮！漂亮的优胜戏码！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76b8c3dde110a21b0d97d40f7a61f734e6a245dbdb1996c35851dd65a47f692",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2a3aabfd7f119dd002533fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜你与<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>一同获得优胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb86700962466780a4d2bb237ee60bc57dd89e2a07f0047b66844a5d0b3bfd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b563fa33503ebf95c6ccc706",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是与<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>间的信赖所诞生的最佳成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e35802f00ffe1d24489c027085dbcc10119a47ec7654f08e6f8e4bb42eb66c33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "100202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc9403739608c3d9c9bd314",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮，漂亮称霸这场重要竞赛的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "239e13ed965116a182b37b25ea7d12193c46e014e011770ce66218d3e750f7f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9520e23e644274bc5966d49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她克服至今的逆境，展现出了相当精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6686b91531df09ea5d47d091a797ee55638d57a4c182c25fa47f2101231fcd34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a06330b07ea83299a036cc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她一扫最近的不佳状态，以完美的表现称霸了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d645d0d539e7671dbc1ff5188f86f8941031020d21617e0a7132a87808b7419",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bace08d756f9e0b7c225069",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于在最佳时机夺下了梦寐以求的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a6f32ade34ef127ee5d09d43dc9a082c787c66aa220cfe16afdcf6b703621c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96ee803e29ced5a7cbe5356",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>漂亮地称霸了战况激烈的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70111cf33528bb8e3435b2c9929fbbb2dc1eee1700fbc877be42a1907078aa5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:054355f4d398121ae1dc3aa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "近期的不佳状态宛如从来不存在似地，以<bashin>压制对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95a468f1e8d4bf0a09d648beb6152de287d777c900e7a9ca81606d312eb9568",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:987e230e0b57d4a155265c87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54e83a348924646a29d7c40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c663f2c283305ded65941534",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a30110a465b138ee4d5c155",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c793bb3e4a0c980172b5b85b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮，在令人屏息的赛况中漂亮获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4817f7ffe97d207c0a4b708ac0f8c75ffcf674db6192909b2f21d33428ef7f3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f4fdc2ba5c19a34512295b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然能有这样的表现，之后应该也相当令人期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a127be14351a39ec66819fdd8c6c057191885b9f728e58317e8a57b5a107b07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08eca6a8883fce6ab0443256",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那就让我们好好地期待她今后的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d349903fd86b1969846620e3d8e7d99f1539748d0921f923962439757d3567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21589ea744b7262c726ba99e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "状态极佳，可以期待她接下来一路过关斩将吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fea2d8a8e40f17918708e7415fd2cd2072aae1a9c4653d99e85684b5b885dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "10202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba39b95023c12295fc91d0d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她成功向大家展现了不亚于评价的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de3e33e41ca31dfa4a749c7165f6bddb036fcf4e399d1ff7344de473ef3b68b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8bb53d5f7122e9543ea094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "加油声沸腾的第1轮。<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdae38e30f10fc94bbf406b4bb3821ddde2625e6c8580ba6e435f547459f57d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "11000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6688fb743b6111d1570f579",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "波澜的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 决赛，称霸这场重大竞赛的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7b556bcb4022ff26d7fa3621aba07941946132d270f61649f3fded5c784c5f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
